  "prefLabel": "Ahp 102.01 Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ahp 102.01 “Board” means “board of directors” as defined in RSA 328-F:2, I, namely, “the chairpersons or their appointees of all the governing boards which shall be responsible for the administrative operation of the office of licensed allied health professionals.”\n\nSource. #7401, eff 11-3-00; ss by #8077, eff 5-1-04; ss by #9517, eff 7-24-09; ss by #12724, eff 2-15-19",
